# Cascade Charter Bus

> Cascade Charter Bus is a nationwide charter bus rental company in the United States. It provides motorcoaches, minibuses, school buses, sprinter vans, sleeper buses, party buses, and SUVs/sedans with DOT-certified drivers for corporate events, weddings, school trips, sports teams, airport transfers, tours, and church groups.

Full content: The complete text of the site's core pages (services, fleet, locations, FAQs, policies) is available as a single Markdown file at [llms-full.txt](https://cascadecharterbus.com/llms-full.txt).

Key facts:
- Service area: Nationwide (USA), coast to coast, with city pages across 48 states. See the Locations page for state and city coverage.
- Headquarters: 12409 Linden Blvd, South Ozone Park, NY 11420, United States
- Phone: +1 (646) 705-0816
- Email: info@cascadecharterbus.com
- Booking: Free custom quotes by phone, email, or the contact form. Pricing depends on vehicle type, group size, trip distance, and duration.
- Group sizes: From small groups in SUVs, sedans, and sprinter vans to 20–32 passenger minibuses and full-size charter buses for large groups.

## Fleet
- [Charter Bus Rental](https://cascadecharterbus.com/fleet/charter-bus/): Full-size motorcoaches for large groups, corporate travel, tours, schools, sports teams, and long-distance trips.
- [Minibus Rental](https://cascadecharterbus.com/fleet/minibus/): 20–32 passenger minibuses for medium-sized groups, local events, and airport shuttles.
- [Sprinter Van Rental](https://cascadecharterbus.com/fleet/sprinter-van/): Sprinter vans for small groups, executive airport transfers, and private tours.
- [SUV & Sedan Service](https://cascadecharterbus.com/fleet/suv-sedan/): Chauffeured SUVs and sedans for business travel, executives, and VIP transfers.
- [Party Bus & Limo Rental](https://cascadecharterbus.com/fleet/party-bus/): Party buses and limo buses for weddings, celebrations, concerts, and nights out.
- [School Bus Rental](https://cascadecharterbus.com/fleet/school-bus/): Budget-friendly school buses for field trips, sports games, camps, and group shuttles.
- [Sleeper Bus Rental](https://cascadecharterbus.com/fleet/sleeper/): Sleeper motorcoaches for multi-day tours, band and entertainer travel, and overnight trips.
- [Fleet Overview](https://cascadecharterbus.com/fleet/): Compare all vehicle types, capacities, and amenities.

## Services
- [Corporate Event Transportation](https://cascadecharterbus.com/services/corporate-transportation/): WiFi-equipped shuttles for conferences, trade shows, retreats, and employee commuting.
- [Wedding Shuttle Bus Rental](https://cascadecharterbus.com/services/wedding-transportation/): Guest shuttles and wedding party transportation between hotels, ceremony, and reception.
- [Group Airport Shuttle](https://cascadecharterbus.com/services/airport-transfer/): Airport transfers for large groups, conference attendees, and tour groups.
- [Sightseeing & Tour Bus Rental](https://cascadecharterbus.com/services/sightseeing-tour-bus/): Custom single-day and multi-day tours built around your stops and schedule.
- [School & Field Trip Transportation](https://cascadecharterbus.com/services/school-transportation/): Safe, affordable buses for field trips, school sports, and academic events.
- [Sports Team Transportation](https://cascadecharterbus.com/services/sports-team-transportation/): Team buses with extra luggage space for equipment, away games, and tournaments.
- [Church & Religious Group Transportation](https://cascadecharterbus.com/services/church-religious-transportation/): Transportation for church services, youth retreats, conferences, and mission trips.
- [Services Overview](https://cascadecharterbus.com/services/): All transportation solutions for corporate, private, and educational groups.

